Z||000000||Wolfhound||10-11-2001||06:09 PM||||For about a year I have known of another Blue 87 GT in Auburn Ala. I have only seen it in when driving another vehicle.<BR>See this Archived post: <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Archives/Archive-000002/HTML/20010706-1-004425.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Archives/Archive-000002/HTML/20010706-1-004425.html</A> <BR>Well, I met him today driving the Gold SE and turned around and gave chase. I caught him at a light, flashed my headlights and motioned for him to pull over. He nodded and motioned ahead and lit the tires up. It turns out he had a 3.4 , 5 speed installed by Ed Parks. We stopped and talked a while and I gave him the forum address. Beautiful car.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>Coy ||||reg||14
